  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Initial beta release of LegioSoft.Imaging.Skia.\n\n      Features:\n      - Refactored into modular structure (Core, Operations, Processors modules)\n      - Fluent builder API (LegioImageBuilder) for easy image manipulation\n      - Resize operations with multiple scale modes (Fit, Fill, Stretch)\n      - Crop, rotate (90/180/270 degrees), flip (horizontal/vertical)\n      - Filter operations: grayscale, sepia, blur (configurable radius), sharpen\n      - Color adjustments: brightness, contrast, invert\n      - Format conversion: PNG, JPEG, WebP\n      - Secure image saving with validation and quality adjustment\n      - Automatic format detection (moved to Core package)\n      - Quality control (0-100) for lossy formats\n      - Load from file, byte array, or stream\n      - Save to file, byte array, or stream\n      - Image info extraction (width, height, format, alpha channel)\n      - Cross-platform (Windows, macOS, Linux)\n      - Support for .NET 6.0, 7.0, 8.0, 9.0, and 10.0",
